/> <i>Non-Affinity </i><i>Transmutation</i><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">: 1 Experiences per level + 1</span></span></span></span><br /> <i>Humanity?</i><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">: 2 Experiences per dot</span></span></span></span><br /> <i>Azoth</i><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">: 5 Experiences per dot</span></span></span></span><br /> <i>Willpower</i><span style=\"color:#999999\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">: 1 Experience per dot</span></span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-04-2015, 04:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T01:20:03-08:00","id":358913,"title":"","content":"What do you mean &quot;Per dot&quot;? I mean, a non-affinity transmutation costs 6 Experiences per dots...? So a 5th level one costs 6 x 5? Thaaaat's a bit much.<br /> <br /> If I had to work on the cost of Transmutations, I'd probably make that first and second level cost 2 Experiences, 3 Experiences for third and fourth and 4 Experiences for the fifth level, and simply add 1 Experience to non-affinity transmutations. 1 Experience per dot means everytime I get 5 beats I can get a first level transmutation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T01:41:00-08:00","id":358922,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jesuncolo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/358889-gmc-promethean-stop-gap?p=358913#post358913\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What do you mean &quot;Per dot&quot;? I mean, a non-affinity transmutation costs 6 Experiences per dots...? So a 5th level one costs 6 x 5? Thaaaat's a bit much.</div> </div> </div> </div>I based the tamplate on my previous, <b>Changeling</b> costs. But I forget the you buy each, concrete Transmutation seperatly, not like Clauses of Changeling, or Arcana of Mage. Idea &quot;per dot&quot; was that when you buy 3rd, 4th and like - each time you pay 5 XP.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jesuncolo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/358889-gmc-promethean-stop-gap?p=358913#post358913\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I had to work on the cost of Transmutations, I'd probably make that first and second level cost 2 Experiences, 3 Experiences for third and fourth and 4 Experiences for the fifth level, and simply add 1 Experience to non-affinity transmutations. 1 Experience per dot means everytime I get 5 beats I can get a first level transmutation.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would just go with N XP for Nth level Transmutaton. So 1st level Transmutation cost 1XP, and 4th cost 4 XP. Non-affinity would add +1 XP cost to this. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I edited costs propositions in first post. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-04-2015, 04:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T11:24:23-08:00","id":359333,"title":"","content":"Check my signature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1S8EuNtxeJKwq4sKVVPe16_N0ylIashKpgfCCuA1UOM8/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Promethean Homebrew.</a><br /> <br /> Yes, I made it the same way as a Promethean. No, the authorities haven't found me yet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/685-ben-quo","name":"Ben Quo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar685_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T16:27:33-08:00","id":359649,"title":"","content":"Oo, and mine! If you'd like to use Simulacre I'll update it to GMC for you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-04T21:54:39-08:00","id":359871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ben Quo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/358889-gmc-promethean-stop-gap?p=359333#post359333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Check my signature.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Stolen XP Costs from Ben Quo. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/s